  "shortDesc": "Location:Escape to a world of luxury and natural beauty at the one-of-a-kind Boutique Hotel. This stunning resort is nestled in  ",
  "longDesc": "<p><strong>Location:</strong>Escape to a world of luxury and natural beauty at the one-of-a-kind Boutique Hotel. This stunning resort is nestled in the majestic Himalayan Mountains, overlooking sprawling green fairways and the serene Beas River. Designed for discerning travelers who appreciate nature, activities, and indulgence, the Boutique Hotel makes for an unforgettable getaway in one of the worlds most beautiful regions. This is hospitality at its finest. In the evenings, gather with loved ones to toast the good life while taking in a breathtaking Himalayan sunset. Whether you seek adventure, indulgence, or serenity, this resort delivers it all. Treat yourself to an escape where luxury meets nature at the one-and-only Boutique Hotel. At Ezzenza Swarg By The Beas at DevLok, we pride ourselves on providing impeccable service tailored to your every need. Our dedicated staff is committed to ensuring your stay exceeds expectations, from arranging personalized excursions to attending to every detail of your comfort and convenience.</p>",
